	(text "I have an idea: since the CHG_GATE signal is already pulling the line low,\nwe can take advantage of that behavior and eliminate the BJT stage entirely.\nInstead, we can place the pull-up resistors on the MOSFET paths and use the CHG_GATE signal directly.\nIf we still want to interface it with the latch using the current logic scheme,\nit should function the same way while reducing the component count and simplifying the design."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 112.014 185.166 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "aedae9a6-83f9-467f-9554-392e7012a144")
	)
